comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-21T05:41:56.036Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-08-21: searched all 2,526 PM items and repository history for whitespace prefix, init prefix validation, and GitHub #1073; existing pm-nmzx covers the distinct missing prefix flag, not invalid persisted values. Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1073"
  "2026-08-21T17:06:12.693Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: focused contract suite passed (9 files, 64 tests); pnpm build, TypeScript public type tests, and full ESLint passed. Full repository gates and packed-runtime acceptance are next."
  "2026-08-21T17:45:41.874Z","harness:codex","Final evidence: the shared SDK normalizePrefix contract canonicalizes whitespace/punctuation to lowercase dash-separated prefixes, rejects the empty result via the existing pm fallback, and persists exactly one trailing dash before create. Linked CLI+SDK tests passed (9/9). Fresh packed npx, bunx, and installed-SDK consumers initialized natural-language prefixes and created IDs matching their canonical prefixes. Full suite passed 551 files / 7702 tests at exact 100% coverage; package and static gates passed."
  "2026-08-21T17:49:37.962Z","harness:codex","Governance evidence correction: classified as production_defect and bound the fix to its executable negative-control test, local packed/full/static gates, and hosted static/coverage owners; no waiver used."
